      "id": 41,
      "definition": {
        "type": "note",
        "content": "## Dashboard Notes\n\n**Metrics Status:**\n- ✅ Core metrics are implemented (tokens, cost, latency, errors)\n- ✅ Provider and model tags are available\n- ⚠️ Custom metrics needed for advanced features (see TODO items above)\n\n**Recommended Alerts:**\n1. Cost spike: Budget burn rate > $10/hour\n2. Quality degradation: Quality score < 7 for 5 minutes\n3. High error rate: Error rate > 5% for 10 minutes\n4. Latency SLA breach: p95 > 10s for 5 minutes\n5. Rate limit warnings: Rate limit hits > 10/hour\n\n**Data Retention:**\n- Live metrics: 15 months\n- Logs: Configurable per plan\n- Traces: 15 days default\n\nFor more information, see: `content/wiki/monitoring/DATADOG_MONITORING.md`",
        "background_color": "white",
        "font_size": "14",
        "text_align": "left",
